118
00:07:33,541 --> 00:07:35,202
I didn't do anything.

119
00:07:35,376 --> 00:07:38,243
She's got a thing for you.

120
00:07:38,413 --> 00:07:40,938
Come on now.
Twenty-four hours ago, she was a...

121
