Married to God.

122
00:07:46,254 --> 00:07:49,417
I understand her ex has a temper.

123
00:07:52,026 --> 00:07:55,291
You guys are blowing this whole thing
out of proportion.

124
00:07:55,463 --> 00:07:58,432
She told me herself
that she just dropped by to thank me...

125
00:07:58,599 --> 00:08:05,562
...and to tell me that she wanted to have
a crazy, wild love affair with life.

126
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:09,971
You don't really need a fishing pole.
They sort of just jump into the boat.

127
00:08:10,144 --> 00:08:11,236
Do you, sir?

128
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:16,516
Your Honor,
I have only two words to say to you:

129
00:08:16,684 --> 00:08:18,208
Rex Baltimore.

130
00:08:18,386 --> 00:08:20,411
Whoa, I've heard this.

131
00:08:21,722 --> 00:08:27,126
When I was very young,
Rex Baltimore was a radio announcer.

132
00:08:27,295 --> 00:08:30,458
He had a voice that would melt butter.

133
00:08:30,631 --> 00:08:36,228
Every night, I would lie next to my radio
and listen to Rex.

134
00:08:36,404 --> 00:08:41,103
I sent him letters. He sent letters back.

135
00:08:41,275 --> 00:08:43,641
I used to hang them over my bed.

136
00:08:43,811 --> 00:08:45,574
That's sweet.

137
00:08:47,215 --> 00:08:52,778
Then one day, he called me up
and asked me out to dinner.

138
00:08:54,121 --> 00:08:56,180
But he never showed up.

139
00:08:56,357 --> 00:08:58,655
I'll never forget how much it hurt.

140
00:08:58,826 --> 00:09:00,521
Gee, that's too bad, Selma.

141
00:09:00,728 --> 00:09:06,030
The point is, this girl is very innocent...

142
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:09,829
...and very trusting, like I was.

143
00:09:10,271 --> 00:09:13,536
She can be hurt very easily, Harry.

144
00:09:13,708 --> 00:09:15,539
Just don't forget that.

145
00:09:15,943 --> 00:09:19,242
That's quite a story, Selma. Thanks.

146
00:09:20,815 --> 00:09:22,112
Selma.

147
00:09:22,283 --> 00:09:24,615
Did you ever find out
why Rex didn't show?

148
00:09:24,785 --> 00:09:26,047
Yes.

149
00:09:26,220 --> 00:09:29,018
The Hindenburg fell on him.

150
00:09:34,128 --> 00:09:36,926
