158
00:10:04,859 --> 00:10:07,851
- What's next, Mac?
- Anita Fries and Arnold Burger.

159
00:10:08,029 --> 00:10:11,760
- Call them, Bull.
- Burger and Fries, please.

160
00:10:16,404 --> 00:10:18,838
