168
00:10:48,703 --> 00:10:50,034
- He's a pervert.
- Oh, come on.

169
00:10:50,204 --> 00:10:54,300
- One little remark does not make me a p...
- Mr. Prosecutor.

170
00:10:55,242 --> 00:10:58,234
I believe she was referring
to your witness.

171
00:10:58,412 --> 00:11:00,380
Of course she was.

172
00:11:01,315 --> 00:11:05,046
