224
00:14:14,508 --> 00:14:18,945
No, that's why I want one.
There's so much to catch up on.

225
00:14:19,113 --> 00:14:22,776
- Sara...
- Harry, I want you to show me everything.

226
00:14:27,521 --> 00:14:31,981
Medical supplies.
I left my samples in the car.

227
00:14:32,159 --> 00:14:34,150
- I love your wit.
- Yeah, Sara...

228
00:14:34,328 --> 00:14:35,590
I love your eyes too.

229
00:14:35,996 --> 00:14:37,896
Thanks, they were a set.

230
00:14:38,065 --> 00:14:41,865
One Harvey Wallbanger,
one kiddie cocktail.

231
00:14:42,036 --> 00:14:45,699
Oh, thank you. It looks delicious.

232
00:14:45,873 --> 00:14:49,400
So do you, my dear.
You have a great woman there, fella.

233
00:14:49,577 --> 00:14:51,568
- She's not my woman.
- Yet.

234
00:14:51,745 --> 00:14:52,769
Yet.

235
00:14:54,982 --> 00:14:56,711
The hunt's on.

236
00:14:56,884 --> 00:14:59,216
No hunting, Ernie. No one's hunting.

237
00:14:59,386 --> 00:15:01,911
- What's sushi?
- Sushi.

238
